language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

scenario StoreApt.
condition StoreAptReady.
condition StoreAptContinue.
condition StoreAptReject.
outcome StoreAptCompleted.
outcome StoreAptRejected.
step StoreAptRoute.
step StoreAptCommit.
step StoreAptEncode.
step StoreAptExport.
step StoreAptWrite.
step StoreAptFailure.
step StoreAptSuccess.
step ReportStoredAptExportFailure.
condition StoredAptExportFailed.
outcome AptStoredArtifactUnavailable.

StoreApt illustrates ManageAptDefinitions.
StoreApt exercises ValidatedAptDefinitions.
StoreApt starts-when StoreAptReady.
StoreApt starts-at StoreAptRoute.
StoreAptReady describes "An identified draft and explicit create/update request exist.".
StoreAptContinue describes "The previous operation succeeded and the next step's declared contract preconditions remain true; exact predicates are an executable-language gap.".
StoreAptReject describes "Validation, authority, applicability or operation failure prevents continuation; preserve prior valid state and report the specific reason.".
StoreAptCompleted describes "The stated design path completed under its explicit obligations; this is not an observed test result.".
StoreAptRejected describes "The path terminated without claiming the requested change succeeded; failures remain observable.".
StoreApt preserves DomainTruthOwned.
StoreApt preserves StableCommandIdentity.
StoreAptRoute calls RouteAptAdminCommand within BuckingLab.
StoreAptRoute describes "Tool uses public Bucking command; never owner storage.".
StoreAptRoute proceeds-to StoreAptFailure when StoreAptReject.
StoreAptRoute proceeds-to StoreAptCommit when StoreAptContinue.
StoreAptCommit calls StoreAptDraft within BuckingService.
StoreAptCommit describes "Validate complete revision and commit the explicitly selected persistence action; the exact lifecycle/schema remains AptEditSchemaGap.".
StoreAptCommit proceeds-to StoreAptFailure when StoreAptReject.
StoreAptCommit proceeds-to StoreAptEncode when StoreAptContinue.
StoreAptEncode calls EncodeClassicApt within BuckingService.
StoreAptEncode describes "Use correct supported codec and preserved companion semantics.".
StoreAptEncode proceeds-to ReportStoredAptExportFailure when StoredAptExportFailed.
StoreAptEncode proceeds-to StoreAptExport when StoreAptContinue.
StoreAptExport calls ExportAptDefinition within BuckingService.
StoreAptExport describes "Return authoritative file identity/bytes/digest.".
StoreAptExport proceeds-to ReportStoredAptExportFailure when StoredAptExportFailed.
StoreAptExport proceeds-to StoreAptWrite when StoreAptContinue.
StoreAptWrite calls TransferLabArtifact within BuckingLab.
StoreAptWrite describes "Write chosen local artifact with bounded transfer and explicit errors.".
StoreAptWrite proceeds-to ReportStoredAptExportFailure when StoredAptExportFailed.
StoreAptWrite proceeds-to StoreAptSuccess when StoreAptContinue.
StoreAptFailure finishes StoreApt with StoreAptRejected.
StoreAptSuccess finishes StoreApt with StoreAptCompleted.
StoreAptRoute emits BuckingRequests through BuckingServiceUpstream.
StoreAptExport emits BuckingResponses through BuckingServiceUpstream.
StoreAptWrite receives BuckingResponses through BuckingServiceUpstream.
StoredAptExportFailed describes "The domain draft was stored, but encoding/export/local artifact transfer failed; retain stored identity/revision and report the failed phase.".
ReportStoredAptExportFailure finishes StoreApt with AptStoredArtifactUnavailable.
AptStoredArtifactUnavailable describes "Stored domain state remains authoritative; requested local export is unavailable or incomplete, never implicit rollback.".
